[h1]Overview[/h1]
Replace the Vanilla climate colours with the [b]Köppen Climate Classification[/b] colours!

[b]⚠️ This mod does not change the map. It only changes the map mode colours! ⚠️[/b]

[quote]The Köppen climate classification is the most widely used climate classification scheme. It was first published by German-Russian climatologist Wladimir Köppen (1846–1940) in 1884, with several later modifications by Köppen, notably in 1918 and 1936. Later, German climatologist Rudolf Geiger (1894–1981) introduced some changes to the classification system in 1954 and 1961, which is thus sometimes called the Köppen–Geiger climate classification.[/quote]

[h2].kml File Included![/h2]
Want to have some fun exploring the real Köppen climate classification map? I've included a [b].kml[/b] file in the mod files! This file can be imported into [url=https://earth.google.com/]Google Earth[/url], which will show the Köppen climate colours as an overlay on the globe :)

